WEBVTT

00:03.350 --> 00:04.400
<b>Jine...</b>

00:05.020 --> 00:08.520
<b>Stop looking at me like that, Battosai.</b>

00:08.520 --> 00:14.740
<b>Your eyes looked so much better
when you said you would kill me.</b>

00:16.200 --> 00:19.200
<b>Your true nature
is still that of a hitokiri.</b>

00:19.200 --> 00:22.450
<b>A fellow hitokiri is telling you,
so you can be sure of it.</b>

00:22.710 --> 00:26.250
<b>A hitokiri is only that until he dies.</b>

00:26.750 --> 00:29.880
<b>He can't become anything else.</b>

00:30.300 --> 00:32.590
<b>I'll be watching from the edges of hell</b>

00:32.590 --> 00:37.390
<b>on how long you can still
spout off about being a rurouni.</b>

00:41.430 --> 00:45.560
<b><i>Jine, you can at least watch
from the edges of hell, that you can.</i></b>

00:46.480 --> 00:48.860
<b><i>Even if my true nature
is that of a hitokiri...</i></b>

00:49.520 --> 00:51.610
<b><i>I will hold it back
for the rest of my life.</i></b>

00:58.530 --> 01:02.750
<b><i>Until I die, I am a rurouni
who refuses to kill, that I am.</i></b>

01:03.620 --> 01:04.500
<b>We're home.</b>

01:05.080 --> 01:06.290
<b>That we are.</b>

02:37.010 --> 02:41.010
<b>EPISODE 8:
BEAUTY ON THE RUN</b>

02:46.930 --> 02:48.230
<b>Stop right there!</b>

02:49.980 --> 02:52.400
<b>I'm tellin' you to stop, damn broad!</b>

02:54.980 --> 02:55.860
<b>Kenshin!</b>

02:56.820 --> 02:57.820
<b>Hey, where are you?</b>

02:58.780 --> 02:59.780
<b>Hey, come on!</b>

03:01.820 --> 03:02.780
<b>Kenshin!</b>

03:04.660 --> 03:05.740
<b>It can't be.</b>

03:05.910 --> 03:08.450
<b>If you're looking for Kenshin,
Sanosuke took him somewhere.</b>

03:09.330 --> 03:10.370
<b>Really?</b>

03:10.370 --> 03:11.870
<b>What good does it do me to lie?</b>

03:11.870 --> 03:16.710
<b>I see. I really thought he wandered off
on a journey for real this time.</b>

03:16.710 --> 03:18.130
<b>I'm so glad.</b>

03:18.130 --> 03:21.340
<b>You know, you're a bit of a worrywart.</b>

03:21.340 --> 03:23.760
<b>Why don't you just
put a collar on Kenshin or something?</b>

03:24.390 --> 03:27.770
<b>A master and her pet Kenshin...</b>

03:27.770 --> 03:29.180
<b><i>Woof, that is!</i></b>

03:30.270 --> 03:31.100
<b>Oh, no!</b>

03:31.100 --> 03:32.730
<b>Don't, "Oh, no," me!</b>

03:33.690 --> 03:36.480
<b>So where did they run off to?</b>

03:36.480 --> 03:38.280
<b>Some restaurant called Shueiya.</b>

03:38.280 --> 03:40.860
<b>He said there's gonna be some gambling
going on there today.</b>

03:41.150 --> 03:42.910
<b>G-Gambling?</b>

03:44.110 --> 03:46.080
<b>Now, now! It's in!</b>

03:46.080 --> 03:47.910
<b>Bet on odds or evens!</b>

03:47.910 --> 03:49.620
<b>- Odd!
- Even!</b>

03:49.620 --> 03:50.870
<b>Which is it?</b>

03:50.870 --> 03:52.870
<b>Five and six for odd... I think.</b>

03:53.370 --> 03:54.290
<b>Odd!</b>

03:54.290 --> 03:55.290
<b>Game results!</b>

03:56.340 --> 03:57.420
<b>Five and six! Odd!</b>

03:58.000 --> 04:00.590
<b>As expected from Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu.</b>

04:00.590 --> 04:02.970
<b>For reading dice,
it's in a whole different class</b>

04:02.970 --> 04:06.760
<b>I tagged along because you said
there was a big problem, Sano.</b>

04:06.760 --> 04:08.390
<b>Gambling is illegal, that it is.</b>

04:08.890 --> 04:10.520
<b>What ya talkin' about?</b>

04:10.520 --> 04:12.890
<b>Your sakabato is illegal, too.</b>

04:13.310 --> 04:15.020
<b>It's against the Sword Abolishment Act.</b>

04:15.020 --> 04:17.150
<b>Thinking of it... that it is.</b>

04:17.150 --> 04:21.570
<b>No worries.
These guys here are all my buddies.</b>

04:22.070 --> 04:25.660
<b>This ain't like gambling as a job
to trick people and con money outta them.</b>

04:25.660 --> 04:28.330
<b>It's a game to enjoy with friends.</b>

04:28.530 --> 04:29.540
<b>However—</b>

04:29.540 --> 04:30.790
<b>We came all the way out here.</b>

04:30.790 --> 04:35.040
<b>Let's have a good ol' time
and stop being all mopey as of today.</b>

04:37.330 --> 04:41.380
<b>Did you hear about Jine's final moments
from Miss Kaoru, that you did?</b>

04:41.550 --> 04:43.800
<b>Oh, I don't know anything.</b>

04:44.340 --> 04:45.550
<b>They're going in!</b>

04:46.340 --> 04:48.260
<b>Anyway, next one! Next!</b>

04:48.760 --> 04:50.510
<b>So is it odd or even this time?</b>

04:52.180 --> 04:54.480
<b>Snake eyes for even, that it is...</b>

04:54.980 --> 04:55.900
<b>probably.</b>

04:56.480 --> 04:58.980
<b>All right! Snake eyes for even!</b>

04:58.980 --> 05:01.980
<b>Hey, Sano, you're doing really well today.</b>

05:01.980 --> 05:05.610
<b>It's the first time in a while,
so go easy on us, man!</b>

05:05.610 --> 05:07.160
<b>That's a great joke.</b>

05:07.160 --> 05:10.490
<b>I'll strip you to your underwear today,
so brace yourselves.</b>

05:10.490 --> 05:11.910
<b>Sano...</b>

05:13.000 --> 05:14.910
<b>You sure gave us a hard time!</b>

05:14.910 --> 05:18.630
<b>You thought you could escape
by yourself, did ya?</b>

05:21.380 --> 05:23.550
<b>Wha? You still plannin' on runnin' off?</b>

05:22.670 --> 05:26.130
<b>RESTAURANT
SHUEIYA</b>

05:23.550 --> 05:24.800
<b>Hold it right there!</b>

05:26.260 --> 05:30.180
<b>By the way, what's with Yoita,
the candy seller today?</b>

05:30.220 --> 05:32.970
<b>Surprised that gambling nut
didn't show his face.</b>

05:33.970 --> 05:36.270
<b>You didn't know, Mr. Sano?</b>

05:37.940 --> 05:41.400
<b>Yoita... passed away earlier this month.</b>

05:42.480 --> 05:46.200
<b>What the hell?
Died from illness or an accident?</b>

05:48.160 --> 05:49.280
<b>Opium.</b>

05:50.620 --> 05:53.240
<b>He accidentally inhaled too much opium.</b>

05:54.660 --> 05:56.500
<b><i>Opium is a narcotic created</i></b>

05:56.500 --> 06:01.750
<b><i>by drying the milky sap
that can be gathered from poppy seeds.</i></b>

06:02.250 --> 06:05.550
<b><i>It creates absolutely terrible
withdrawal symptoms,</i></b>

06:05.550 --> 06:08.590
<b><i>so in this era,
it was strictly prohibited</i></b>

06:08.590 --> 06:11.550
<b><i>as an evil drug
that could destroy an entire nation.</i></b>

06:13.560 --> 06:17.390
<b>That idiot!
Why did he dabble in opium?</b>

06:18.060 --> 06:19.850
<b>But that is strange, that it is.</b>

06:20.350 --> 06:22.690
<b>Opium is quite an expensive drug.</b>

06:23.190 --> 06:27.150
<b>It shouldn't be something
that an ordinary man can buy a hoard of.</b>

06:27.860 --> 06:28.700
<b>Hmm?</b>

06:31.280 --> 06:32.870
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

06:37.040 --> 06:38.210
<b>Please help me!</b>

06:38.210 --> 06:39.290
<b>Oro?</b>

06:39.580 --> 06:43.590
<b>Evil men are after me. Please, help me!</b>

06:43.590 --> 06:44.590
<b>Uh...</b>

06:44.590 --> 06:46.260
<b>God damn it, Megumi!</b>

06:46.840 --> 06:48.470
<b>You can't get away now!</b>

06:49.430 --> 06:52.430
<b>One after another.
Who the hell are you guys?</b>

06:52.430 --> 06:54.350
<b>Shut up! You stay outta this!</b>

06:54.350 --> 06:56.310
<b>Hurry up, and hand that broad over!</b>

06:56.310 --> 06:57.430
<b>If you don't—</b>

06:59.770 --> 07:02.310
<b>I'm kinda irritated right now!</b>

07:02.310 --> 07:04.520
<b>You better watch how you talk to me!</b>

07:04.520 --> 07:08.610
<b>D-D-Damn you.
You think you can get away with this?</b>

07:08.820 --> 07:11.910
<b>We are Mr. Kanryu's private army!</b>

07:11.910 --> 07:13.570
<b>The fact you're standing up against us</b>

07:13.570 --> 07:16.290
<b>means that you're gonna
make enemies with Mr. Kanryu!</b>

07:16.290 --> 07:17.240
<b>Huh?</b>

07:17.240 --> 07:19.500
<b>I told you to watch it, weakling!</b>

07:19.500 --> 07:20.580
<b>Kanryu.</b>

07:20.580 --> 07:21.580
<b>That's bad news.</b>

07:21.580 --> 07:23.750
<b>He's talking about Kanryu Takeda.</b>

07:23.750 --> 07:25.500
<b>Kanryu Takeda?</b>

07:25.500 --> 07:27.550
<b>Who in the world is that man, that is?</b>

07:29.090 --> 07:32.550
<b>He's a young entrepreneur
living on the outskirts of town,</b>

07:32.550 --> 07:33.890
<b>at least on the outside.</b>

07:34.430 --> 07:36.680
<b>Who knows what he's doing
behind the scenes, though?</b>

07:36.680 --> 07:39.930
<b>He's suddenly gotten very wealthy
in the past few years.</b>

07:39.930 --> 07:42.480
<b>Nowadays, he's even got
a giant private army.</b>

07:42.480 --> 07:44.230
<b>A fishy guy, if you ask me.</b>

07:44.690 --> 07:49.490
<b>Everyone in this town, from the yakuza
to the politicians, avoid fighting him.</b>

07:50.150 --> 07:52.240
<b>So if they're part of his private army,</b>

07:52.240 --> 07:54.280
<b>are you Kanryu's girl?</b>

07:54.280 --> 07:55.370
<b>I am not!</b>

07:55.990 --> 07:58.910
<b>I really don't know anything.</b>

07:59.500 --> 08:01.620
<b>Not about this Kanryu person, either.</b>

08:01.620 --> 08:05.000
<b>Lying isn't good, Megumi Takani.</b>

08:09.340 --> 08:10.420
<b>What the...</b>

08:10.420 --> 08:12.420
<b>When the hell did he come inside?</b>

08:13.930 --> 08:17.470
<b>Looks like you ran 'cause you thought
only two guys were watching you.</b>

08:17.470 --> 08:21.930
<b>But one of our leader's men
is always watching you.</b>

08:24.060 --> 08:24.940
<b>Hmph.</b>

08:25.190 --> 08:28.900
<b>But it's true that I'm not Kanryu's girl!</b>

08:29.400 --> 08:33.820
<b>Go home, and tell Kanryu that I
will make sure to get away from him!</b>

08:35.990 --> 08:37.870
<b>How cute.</b>

08:37.870 --> 08:41.790
<b>Especially how you think you can get away.</b>

08:42.500 --> 08:43.330
<b>Damn you!</b>

08:43.330 --> 08:44.960
<b>Hurry up, and get out of here!</b>

08:46.750 --> 08:47.960
<b>Tomo! Ginji!</b>

08:48.540 --> 08:50.670
<b>Sengeki Rasenbyo.</b>

08:50.670 --> 08:54.180
<b>That was just saying hello,
but next time, Megumi...</b>

08:54.680 --> 08:56.640
<b>I will shatter your feet.</b>

08:56.640 --> 08:58.890
<b>It will double as your punishment.</b>

09:06.310 --> 09:08.150
<b><i>A tatami flip?</i></b>

09:08.150 --> 09:10.150
<b><i>But my tacks can—</i></b>

09:10.150 --> 09:12.110
<b>I'm not quite understanding
the circumstances.</b>

09:15.030 --> 09:20.990
<b>I cannot quietly watch people
getting hurt or killed, that I can't.</b>

09:21.540 --> 09:22.870
<b>Like you know anything!</b>

09:23.120 --> 09:25.160
<b>Damn you, how dare you
do that to my buddies?</b>

09:25.160 --> 09:26.040
<b>Huh?</b>

09:29.710 --> 09:31.590
<b>This can't be good.</b>

09:31.800 --> 09:35.220
<b>They knocked out
three of Kanryu Takeda's personal army.</b>

09:37.760 --> 09:38.840
<b><i>They're strong.</i></b>

09:39.350 --> 09:42.180
<b><i>Especially the swordsman.
He seems invincible.</i></b>

09:43.520 --> 09:47.690
<b>How about it, boys? Can you protect me
and let me escape from Kanryu's grasp?</b>

09:48.190 --> 09:51.440
<b>I'll pay more than enough as a reward.
How about it?</b>

09:51.440 --> 09:54.740
<b>But before that,
why don't you explain yourself?</b>

09:54.740 --> 09:55.650
<b>Huh?</b>

09:55.650 --> 09:56.530
<b>Ow!</b>

09:56.530 --> 09:58.530
<b>Two of my buddies got hurt.</b>

09:58.530 --> 10:00.950
<b>I won't be satisfied
until I hear the reason behind it!</b>

10:00.950 --> 10:01.950
<b>That hurts!</b>

10:01.950 --> 10:03.830
<b>Don't grab me with ridiculous strength!</b>

10:03.830 --> 10:04.790
<b>Oh...</b>

10:08.330 --> 10:09.750
<b>That's opium!</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:12.460
<b>That package was lying around
in Yoita's place!</b>

10:14.800 --> 10:19.010
<b>By reward, surely you
can't mean this, that you can't?</b>

10:24.060 --> 10:27.060
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

10:29.730 --> 10:32.360
<b>Kenshin and Sanosuke sure are late.</b>

10:32.360 --> 10:35.480
<b>Guess it's quite a win
or quite a loss, huh?</b>

10:35.480 --> 10:36.740
<b>If they're on the losing end,</b>

10:36.740 --> 10:39.280
<b>they probably lost their clothes
and only got on underwear.</b>

10:39.280 --> 10:40.280
<b>Huh?</b>

10:43.780 --> 10:45.580
<b>No. I don't wanna see something like that.</b>

10:46.200 --> 10:47.080
<b>We're back!</b>

10:47.790 --> 10:49.870
<b>Kenshin! Welcome ba—</b>

10:51.330 --> 10:53.420
<b>Quite a run-down house.</b>

10:53.420 --> 10:54.920
<b>Is it a school for swordsmanship?</b>

10:56.380 --> 10:59.220
<b>Oh, this is Miss Megumi Takani.</b>

10:59.630 --> 11:01.840
<b>There was a bit of a tussle
at the gambling house—</b>

11:02.090 --> 11:05.260
<b>And the guys wouldn't pay up our winnings,</b>

11:05.260 --> 11:07.350
<b>so we brought this girl home
as payment instead.</b>

11:07.770 --> 11:10.190
<b>Sorry, but she's gonna
have to stay here for a bit.</b>

11:10.690 --> 11:13.690
<b>I see. So it was a big win for you guys.</b>

11:13.980 --> 11:15.360
<b>Sano...</b>

11:15.360 --> 11:16.900
<b>If we tell her the truth,</b>

11:16.900 --> 11:18.780
<b>opium is gonna be
part of the chat, right?</b>

11:18.780 --> 11:20.610
<b>It's better if we
kept quiet about it here.</b>

11:20.950 --> 11:22.030
<b>Kenshin...</b>

11:23.320 --> 11:25.870
<b>is that the truth?</b>

11:26.160 --> 11:28.870
<b>You don't want to carelessly
get them involved in this, do you?</b>

11:31.580 --> 11:32.830
<b>Kenshin.</b>

11:35.500 --> 11:38.670
<b>It's the truth, that it is.</b>

11:38.920 --> 11:40.220
<b>I totally misjudged you!</b>

11:42.050 --> 11:44.550
<b>I didn't think you'd do something
like human trafficking!</b>

11:44.550 --> 11:45.390
<b>Oro...</b>

11:45.390 --> 11:48.100
<b>I can see Sanosuke doing something
like that, but you, Kenshin?</b>

11:48.100 --> 11:49.600
<b>What's up with that?</b>

11:49.810 --> 11:52.810
<b>Um... Miss Takani, was it?</b>

11:53.060 --> 11:56.570
<b>I'm sorry. I'll give him
a nice long lecture about this.</b>

11:56.570 --> 11:58.230
<b>So please, you can go back home now.</b>

11:58.230 --> 12:01.450
<b>- Oh, I have no intention of going back.
- Huh?</b>

12:01.450 --> 12:04.410
<b>I have taken a fondness to him.</b>

12:04.410 --> 12:06.910
<b>I don't want to be apart from him.
Not even a moment.</b>

12:08.200 --> 12:14.080
<b>You're better off with me compared to
such a sweaty little girl, right, Ken-san?</b>

12:14.080 --> 12:16.790
<b>Oh. Kenshin, you're pretty smooth—</b>

12:17.800 --> 12:20.130
<b>N-No! You absolutely can't do that!</b>

12:20.130 --> 12:22.130
<b>Oh, and why is that?</b>

12:22.470 --> 12:26.640
<b>It doesn't seem like you're
Ken-san's girlfriend or anything.</b>

12:26.640 --> 12:29.010
<b>Are in a position
that you can say such a thing?</b>

12:29.680 --> 12:31.810
<b>Don't tease her so much.</b>

12:31.810 --> 12:34.400
<b>This girl is really simpleminded.</b>

12:35.400 --> 12:38.360
<b>Get out! All of you!</b>

12:40.610 --> 12:48.620
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN
SCHOOL OF KENDO</b>

12:41.150 --> 12:42.320
<b>Good grief.</b>

12:42.820 --> 12:44.570
<b>Oh, brother, that is.</b>

12:44.570 --> 12:48.620
<b>It's your fault for saying something
that you don't mean at all.</b>

12:48.830 --> 12:52.410
<b>Oh, it's true that I don't want
to be separated even for an instant.</b>

12:52.410 --> 12:56.330
<b>I mean, he's tremendously strong,
yet really good-natured.</b>

12:56.580 --> 13:00.050
<b>I feel like if I'm at his side, he's sure
to protect me even if I am assaulted.</b>

13:00.840 --> 13:05.260
<b>Kenshin Himura, was it?
You're perfect as a bodyguard.</b>

13:06.470 --> 13:10.640
<b>If that's the case, I would at least like
to hear your circumstances, that I would.</b>

13:10.810 --> 13:14.350
<b>I agree. What's your background?</b>

13:14.890 --> 13:17.940
<b>Why are you trying to run from Kanryu?</b>

13:17.940 --> 13:21.070
<b>And why is Kanryu so persistent
about chasing after you?</b>

13:21.280 --> 13:25.030
<b>And this!
How and where in the hell did you get it?</b>

13:25.530 --> 13:27.820
<b>You're so insensitive
to ask a woman about her past.</b>

13:27.820 --> 13:28.820
<b>Moron!</b>

13:28.820 --> 13:29.830
<b>There, there.</b>

13:30.530 --> 13:33.540
<b>Oh, well. As long as I stick around you,</b>

13:33.540 --> 13:36.000
<b>I'll get to the source of the opium
in due time.</b>

13:36.000 --> 13:38.540
<b>The source of what killed my buddy!</b>

13:39.040 --> 13:43.380
<b>I can't allow this to get around
in the streets more than it does now.</b>

13:43.550 --> 13:45.720
<b>I'll make sure to shut it down!</b>

13:46.130 --> 13:47.470
<b>Hmph.</b>

13:47.470 --> 13:48.550
<b>Mr. Sano!</b>

13:49.550 --> 13:52.520
<b>So this is where you were!
I've been looking quite a bit for you!</b>

13:52.520 --> 13:56.520
<b>Shu. Weren't you taking
Gin and Tomo to the doctor?</b>

13:56.520 --> 13:59.520
<b>Yeah. Gin and Tomo are okay for now.</b>

13:59.650 --> 14:01.570
<b>But we have a big problem.</b>

14:01.570 --> 14:02.820
<b>Please come with me!</b>

14:04.740 --> 14:06.650
<b>Hey, what's going on?</b>

14:11.990 --> 14:14.620
<b>Those are Kanryu's
private army guys from earlier!</b>

14:15.160 --> 14:16.710
<b>This is terrible, that it is.</b>

14:17.250 --> 14:20.290
<b>Those that are of no use
get mercilessly taken out.</b>

14:21.040 --> 14:22.960
<b>This is how Kanryu always does things.</b>

14:35.680 --> 14:36.520
<b>Beshimi.</b>

14:36.520 --> 14:37.350
<b>Y-Yes, sir!</b>

14:37.730 --> 14:40.270
<b>The swordsman who crushed your nose,</b>

14:40.270 --> 14:44.480
<b>you said he was a redhead with
a cross-shaped scar on his left cheek?</b>

14:44.690 --> 14:45.530
<b>Yes.</b>

14:46.190 --> 14:47.570
<b>Huh? Oh!</b>

14:47.570 --> 14:49.990
<b>Argh! It's him! And Megumi's there, too!</b>

14:49.990 --> 14:52.450
<b>This is perfect! I'll kill 'em right here—</b>

14:52.580 --> 14:56.200
<b>Trouble in the crowd would bother me.</b>

14:56.330 --> 14:57.160
<b>Stop it.</b>

14:57.660 --> 14:59.790
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

15:00.290 --> 15:03.290
<b>In any case,
that man is no ordinary fellow.</b>

15:03.290 --> 15:06.590
<b>Beshimi, you can't possibly
handle him on your own.</b>

15:07.210 --> 15:09.510
<b>The fact that they're here means...</b>

15:10.010 --> 15:12.470
<b>Han'nya, you're here as well?</b>

15:13.100 --> 15:14.310
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

15:14.810 --> 15:16.890
<b>Have you figured out their whereabouts?</b>

15:17.390 --> 15:21.560
<b>Yes. That man was quite a keen fellow,</b>

15:21.560 --> 15:24.820
<b>so it was quite troublesome
to follow him, but I managed.</b>

15:25.270 --> 15:29.490
<b>All right. You should help with Beshimi's
job of getting Megumi Takani back.</b>

15:29.490 --> 15:33.200
<b>Tell Hyottoko to help as well.</b>

15:33.700 --> 15:34.780
<b>Understood.</b>

15:35.030 --> 15:38.200
<b>Listen, Beshimi.
I'm assigning two helpers for you.</b>

15:38.830 --> 15:40.920
<b>I won't allow for any more failure.</b>

15:41.420 --> 15:44.290
<b>I will take that to heart.
Now excuse me.</b>

15:46.250 --> 15:49.130
<b>You're giving him a second chance.</b>

15:49.130 --> 15:51.930
<b>You are quite the sympathetic leader.</b>

15:51.930 --> 15:53.390
<b>You think so?</b>

15:53.390 --> 15:57.560
<b>I do think so.
I cannot possibly do something like that.</b>

15:58.100 --> 16:00.640
<b>I am an entrepreneur at my roots.</b>

16:01.350 --> 16:04.610
<b>Wasteful, useless men
must be quickly eradicated,</b>

16:04.610 --> 16:06.610
<b>or I don't feel at ease.</b>

16:07.610 --> 16:13.070
<b>And when the eradication is complete,
I feel completely refreshed.</b>

16:13.820 --> 16:15.320
<b>That aside...</b>

16:15.700 --> 16:18.660
<b>Miss Megumi deeply troubles me.</b>

16:19.450 --> 16:23.620
<b>She is my dear little hen
that lays my precious golden eggs.</b>

16:23.620 --> 16:26.130
<b>I will never let her get away.</b>

16:28.050 --> 16:28.880
<b>Kanryu!</b>

16:29.340 --> 16:31.050
<b>No doubt about it.</b>

16:31.050 --> 16:34.090
<b>Kenshin, that guy
with the glasses is Kanryu.</b>

16:34.090 --> 16:36.970
<b>More importantly,
the man standing to his right.</b>

16:37.510 --> 16:39.520
<b>Who in the world is he, that is?</b>

16:39.520 --> 16:42.980
<b>Don't know.
Maybe the head of the private army?</b>

16:42.980 --> 16:43.810
<b>He isn't!</b>

16:44.810 --> 16:45.650
<b>He is...</b>

16:45.650 --> 16:46.860
<b>the leader!</b>

16:47.860 --> 16:51.860
<b>That man leads a group
separate from the private army,</b>

16:51.860 --> 16:56.450
<b>the Oniwaban Group, a group of
former onmitsu that Kanryu recently hired.</b>

16:57.450 --> 17:02.830
<b><i>Onmitsu were tricksters
active during the Edo era.</i></b>

17:03.370 --> 17:06.580
<b><i>Nowadays, they are often referred to
as shinobi or ninja.</i></b>

17:07.290 --> 17:09.710
<b><i>The Oniwaban Group was
a secret organization among them</i></b>

17:09.710 --> 17:13.420
<b><i>working directly for the Shogun,
comprised of those</i></b>

17:13.420 --> 17:17.010
<b><i>that excelled in combat tactics
more than any other onmitsu.</i></b>

17:17.930 --> 17:24.390
<b>And that is the genius onmitsu who became
the head of the Edo Castle Oniwaban Group</b>

17:24.390 --> 17:28.770
<b>right before the Meiji Revolution
at the age of 15, Aoshi Shinomori!</b>

17:30.320 --> 17:33.940
<b>And why did someone like that
fall into Kanryu's ranks?</b>

17:33.940 --> 17:36.450
<b>No idea. In any case,</b>

17:36.450 --> 17:40.410
<b>we're up against a shady entrepreneur
and the dangerous Oniwaban Group.</b>

17:40.870 --> 17:44.080
<b>We can't afford to toss Miss Megumi out
at this point, that we can't.</b>

17:45.580 --> 17:47.540
<b><i>Red hair and a cross-shaped scar.</i></b>

17:48.500 --> 17:49.540
<b><i>It can't be...</i></b>

17:55.220 --> 17:57.640
<b>So there are about 60 people</b>

17:56.010 --> 18:01.470
<b>SWORDSMEN     YAKUZA
(10)                   (3)</b>

17:56.010 --> 18:01.470
<b>PAGES     GUNMEN
   (10)            (10)</b>

17:56.010 --> 18:01.470
<b>LEADER

ONIWABAN GROUP</b>

17:56.010 --> 18:01.470
<b>PRIVATE ARMY</b>

17:56.010 --> 18:01.470
<b>KANRYU TAKEDA</b>

17:57.640 --> 18:00.220
<b>in Kanryu's private army, that is?</b>

18:00.640 --> 18:01.470
<b>Right.</b>

18:01.850 --> 18:03.310
<b>What about the Oniwaban Group?</b>

18:03.310 --> 18:05.270
<b>I think five or six.</b>

18:07.140 --> 18:11.480
<b>Next, where did you get a hold of opium,
that you did?</b>

18:13.110 --> 18:16.700
<b>You're still staying silent
when it comes to opium, that you are.</b>

18:16.860 --> 18:20.780
<b>I'm talking only so that
it's easier for you to fight.</b>

18:20.780 --> 18:22.620
<b>Opium has nothing to do with it.</b>

18:23.120 --> 18:26.910
<b>Don't ask what you don't need to ask,
and just fend them off for me.</b>

18:27.750 --> 18:32.090
<b><i>That said, if the Oniwaban Group
is seriously on the move now,</i></b>

18:32.090 --> 18:34.380
<b><i>these guys will be no match against them.</i></b>

18:34.880 --> 18:36.550
<b><i>No need to stay here too long.</i></b>

18:36.550 --> 18:38.430
<b><i>It's best if I use
the hubbub of the battle</i></b>

18:38.430 --> 18:40.590
<b><i>as cover to flee even further.</i></b>

18:41.140 --> 18:43.350
<b>So Miss Megumi, to begin with—</b>

18:43.350 --> 18:46.100
<b>I told you,
I won't answer any personal questions!</b>

18:46.270 --> 18:48.690
<b>It's not good to eavesdrop, missie.</b>

18:48.890 --> 18:50.770
<b>But—But—But—But—But—But...</b>

18:50.770 --> 18:53.650
<b>they decided to coop themselves up alone
right after they got back!</b>

18:53.980 --> 18:58.280
<b>It's fine. It's nothing
like what you're worried about.</b>

18:58.780 --> 19:00.490
<b>Then what is it about?</b>

19:00.910 --> 19:03.530
<b>It's in his nature, his temperament.</b>

19:04.580 --> 19:09.330
<b>He can't help but assist those in need
or those with issues.</b>

19:09.830 --> 19:12.000
<b>It's his nature as a rurouni.</b>

19:12.710 --> 19:14.960
<b>You know how he's
super powerful with his sword,</b>

19:14.960 --> 19:17.170
<b>but is totally weak against people.</b>

19:17.670 --> 19:19.630
<b>Especially women and children.</b>

19:20.890 --> 19:22.180
<b>You have a point.</b>

19:22.600 --> 19:24.310
<b>So are you like that, too, Sanosuke?</b>

19:24.310 --> 19:25.350
<b>Gimme a break.</b>

19:25.350 --> 19:27.770
<b>I just wanna avenge my buddy.</b>

19:27.770 --> 19:30.850
<b>I don't care about what happens
to foxes like that!</b>

19:32.060 --> 19:34.650
<b>Sano, is nothing out of the ordinary?</b>

19:34.650 --> 19:35.570
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:35.860 --> 19:37.990
<b>This is the organization chart
for Kanryu's group.</b>

19:37.990 --> 19:40.110
<b>It'd be good to take a look at it,
that it would.</b>

19:40.530 --> 19:43.120
<b>As the Oniwaban Group is on their side,</b>

19:43.120 --> 19:45.780
<b>it's best to believe
they already know about this place.</b>

19:46.330 --> 19:48.370
<b>We can't be caught off our guard,
that we can't.</b>

19:49.080 --> 19:52.500
<b>Miss Kaoru,
I can't talk about the details,</b>

19:52.500 --> 19:56.090
<b>but there may be a trouble or two here
in the future.</b>

19:56.630 --> 19:59.800
<b>I will not fail ever again
like I did with Jine.</b>

20:00.260 --> 20:03.180
<b>I will make sure to protect you.</b>

20:05.430 --> 20:07.010
<b>All right.</b>

20:07.010 --> 20:10.390
<b>But when everything is settled,
you need to give me a proper explanation.</b>

20:14.190 --> 20:16.770
<b>I heard that, Kenshin.</b>

20:17.690 --> 20:19.610
<b>You said there might be trouble?</b>

20:19.610 --> 20:21.610
<b>Yahiko, how long have you been there?</b>

20:21.610 --> 20:23.070
<b>Ever since nightfall.</b>

20:23.070 --> 20:24.820
<b>I didn't notice.</b>

20:24.820 --> 20:28.290
<b>Anyway, am I the only one
left out of all this?</b>

20:28.290 --> 20:30.370
<b>I'm part of Team Kenshin, too, aren't I?</b>

20:30.620 --> 20:32.000
<b>What's that?</b>

20:32.000 --> 20:33.580
<b>When was that formed, that is?</b>

20:33.960 --> 20:36.170
<b>Little brats
don't need to mouth off like that.</b>

20:36.290 --> 20:37.840
<b>What was that, damn it?</b>

20:37.840 --> 20:40.130
<b>Sanosuke, you need to think
before you talk!</b>

20:40.420 --> 20:42.090
<b>I was here before you to begin with—</b>

20:44.970 --> 20:47.390
<b>And that's exactly
why you're still a brat.</b>

20:47.390 --> 20:48.310
<b>Huh? What you mean?</b>

20:50.560 --> 20:51.850
<b>They're here!</b>

20:52.060 --> 20:53.060
<b>Over towards the gate!</b>

21:02.740 --> 21:04.950
<b>You must be the Oniwaban Group,
that you are.</b>

21:05.950 --> 21:08.700
<b>Quietly hand Megumi over.</b>

21:08.700 --> 21:11.700
<b>If you do, I'll go a little easy on you.</b>

22:45.090 --> 22:50.090
<b>NEXT EPISODE
THE ONIWABANSHU STRIKE</b>

22:46.090 --> 22:48.840
<b><i>Next episode, "The Oniwabanshu Strike."</i></b>
